{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"dynova-kaponata","title":"Dýňová kaponáta","description":"Sladkokyselá sicilská zeleninová příloha s pečenou dýní, řapíkatým celerem, olivami a kapary.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":5,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":25,"cookMinutes":35,"category":"Přílohy","tags":["Italská kuchyně","Veganské","Dýně"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"dyne","name":"máslová dýně nebo jiná dýně","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1000},"unit":"g","note":"na kostky"},{"id":"olej","name":"olivový olej","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"na pečení a restování"}},{"id":"sul","name":"sůl","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"podle chuti"}},{"id":"celer","name":"řapíkatý celer","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":4},"unit":"ks","note":"stonky"},{"id":"kapary","name":"kapary","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"hrst"}},{"id":"olivy","name":"olivy","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"hrst, vypeckované"}},{"id":"cervena-cibule","name":"velká červená cibule","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"passata","name":"rajčatová passata","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":200},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"rozinky","name":"rozinky","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":50},"unit":"g","note":"volitelné"},{"id":"piniove-orechy","name":"piniové oříšky nebo mandle","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":30},"unit":"g","note":"volitelné"},{"id":"cukr","name":"cukr","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":50},"unit":"g"},{"id":"ocet","name":"červený vinný ocet","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":50},"unit":"ml"}]}],"steps":["Dýni promíchejte s olejem a solí a pečte při 180 °C dozlatova.","Celer 5 minut povařte, slijte a nakrájejte na kousky. Kapary podle potřeby propláchněte.","Na oleji změkněte cibuli, přidejte passatu, kapary, olivy, rozinky a oříšky. Uprostřed pánve nechte rozpustit cukr v octu, pak vše promíchejte a 1–2 minuty provařte.","Zlehka vmíchejte dýni a celer, aby zůstaly vcelku. Nechte alespoň 2 hodiny odležet."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.theguardian.com/food/2021/no